<title>INDIA: Bank of India net up at 3.6 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>Bank of India net up at 3.6 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-run Bank of India said on Thursday its net profit for 1996/97 (April-March) rose to 3.60 billion rupees from 2.76 billion the previous year.</p>
<p>Earnings per share rose to 6.03 rupees from 4.75, the bank said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The bank said its total deposits grew 16.2 percent to 319.73 billion rupees and loans rose 17.6 percent to 183.37 billion.</p>
<p>Income for the year was 40.04 billion rupees against 33.11 billion, the statement added.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
